              "x": 9.333333333333336,
              "width": 86
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Delilah, Who Rules Absolutely, is the light. She floods the senses with hope to bring the peace of dominion to all who would receive her.*\n\nCall out her name and Delilah shines forth, taking control of a mind that means you harm. Summoning requires 1 Action.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Grit vs. your target’s Aura.\n- **Success:** Delilah forms around your target like a halo.\n - You can target a foe up to 1 Battlefield Area away from you. \n - You can control your target for the next Turn. For example, you can make them speak, drop a powerful item, or attack an ally.\n - Delilah vanishes after your target performs the controlled action.\n- **Failure:** Delilah (played by your GM) decides your next Turn, then vanishes with a lingering laugh.\n - Delilah would never cause you to directly harm yourself, though she might have you throw an important item aside or shout at enemies you’re hiding from."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "type": "range",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[A][M] Imperatrix Delilah",
    "subtype": "heretic",
