          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*You are a master of cutting a destructive path through a swarm of enemies.*\n\nIf you land a finishing blow against an opponent in Melee, you gain a Chain Attack against another foe in the same Area.\n- **Rank 1**: You have one Chain Attack per Round which…\n  - Has a Minor Bonus (+2) on the Attack roll.\n  - Does an extra Heart of Damage if you land a successful strike.\n- **Rank 5**: You gain a second Chain Attack, if the previous one also finishes its opponent."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "champion",
    "displayName": "[S] Combat Momentum",
    "id": "1Quaho411oA37aFiShy8"
  },
