    "subtype": "murder princess",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[A][M] Sword Storm",
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FtqQjcOy1DKSSu8hQYjDc.png?alt=media&token=33da645c-3a60-43ee-9e77-d7d047f3d138"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*With a cry of defiance you can summon a blizzard of magical blades that tear through anyone nearby.*\n\nOn your Turn you can summon clones of your Wrath’s Blade (or ammunition if it’s a Missile Weapon) to appear over the Battlefield, that rain down upon anyone surrounding you:\n- You make a single Attack roll.\n- The result of the roll is used as an Attack roll against everyone in the same Battlefield Area as you.\n- A hit does 2 Hearts of Damage.\n- Characters who have a Social Bond with you are exempt from the Attack.\n- After the Storm, the summoned weapons disintegrate.\n\nYou can use Sword Storm once every 24 hours without penalty. Using a Sword Storm in excess of this means you have to roll on the Injury Table after use."
        },
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "type": "range",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        }
      }
    ],
    "id": "5EudpQP7IHO49NWINAc6"
  },
  {
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FU5vD1BJuto1FFJpws6wQ.png?alt=media&token=36a9ca31-c50a-4234-8b2a-5046d44229bc",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*Tacticians live in the moment. Strategists live two steps ahead. Your foes will learn the difference once it’s too late!*\n\nYou can take a single Action during an enemy’s Turn to perform a countermeasure to their intended Action.\n\nIf your intervention renders the foe’s declared Action impossible, they are forced to choose a new course of action or lose their Turn.\n\nUsing this Ability means that you cannot act on your next Turn."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[A] Uncanny Strategist",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "champion",
