    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "subtype": "heretic",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[A][M] Altgrave Ultima",
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FechDriyMq4j6jiFMTe8A.png?alt=media&token=1cb9a3bf-ea22-47af-a25d-84559d910919",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "height": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%"
            }
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Ultima, Whose Fist is Just, is a massive warrior in ultra-heavy armor who is keen to mete out justice on your behalf.*\n\nThrow your arms wide open, shout his name dramatically, and Ultima appears to smite a foe. Summoning requires 1 Action.\n\n**Requires a Grit Check**\n- **Success:** Ultima thunders towards a target of your choice. He shouts their greatest sin aloud (For example: Pride!, Indolence!, or Chicanery!) and hammers them with his enormous righteous fist.\n - You can target any foe up to 1 Battlefield Area away from you.\n - The target takes 1 Heart of Damage and must make a Might Check:\n   - Success: They partially deflect the blow and avoid further damage.\n   - Failure: They have been smashed to the ground, taking an additional Heart of Damage and are now Toppled. \n- **Failure:** Ultima appears behind you and swats you to the ground before vanishing. You are Toppled."
        }
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        },
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "id": "Ag8QI1J4RORWJdDr37yF"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F7pDM7eJPlZdoLHLYA2bN.png?alt=media&token=8ae317bc-67ce-4e58-be6a-fbf1836eae4d",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*You have a distaste for direct combat and your mind is often looking for a way to help without going toe to toe.*\n\nDuring a Fight, your opponents will not target you for Attack in any Turn where you are not intending to perform an offensive Action, or doing something that will obviously cause them harm or spoil their plans. For example, healing a friend would go unchecked but setting up a bomb would not."
        }
      }
    ],
    "subtype": "factotum",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[S] Don't Mind Me",
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "id": "Am7AdPhMiQqqvHv7pg5A"
  },
