          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*A few extra spikes here, a metal plate or two there, and your bulky Factotum’s Pack is now combat ready! Cower behind it or swing it at your foes.*\n\nOn your combat Turn, you can use your Pack as either:\n- A Mighty Weapon, or…\n- A Large Shield.\n\nGear Allowance Restrictions don’t apply when using your Pack as a piece of Combat Gear."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
