    "type": "Abilities",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "Murder Princess",
    "displayName": "[S][M] Wrath Bolt",
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F2TmcUnDWj1QjKNrHMm85.png?alt=media&token=55af5c92-e577-40db-87ee-f9dd8a900a34",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 8.999999999999963,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 89,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 89.29765886287625
            }
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*You are able to fill your hand with dark, crackling energy. This charged mana can be hurled at your enemies or used to envelop your Wrath’s Blade.*\n\n**Wrath Blade**: If you envelop your Wrath’s Blade with this Ability it now deals Dark Damage instead of Mundane Damage.\n\n**Wrath Bolts**: You are able to fire Wrath Bolts at enemies up to one Battlefield Area away. Bolts strike as Thrown Missile Weapons. Bolts do 1 Heart of Dark Damage on a successful Attack.\n\n**Weapon Ability, Hidden Fangs:** \nIf your target isn’t aware of your Thrown Weapon, you may attempt to Ambush them, even when you are in plain sight.\n- Targets must be in Range, but otherwise this attack works like a normal Ambush (􀂴 p252).\n- If your Ambush is successful, others using Concealed or Thrown weapons can join in the Ambush."
        }
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "id": "H7Zh8hNCTjMczUPbCdtq"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FsrddYwcCABukR8Iygury.png?alt=media&token=14afeba2-45a1-450e-b436-48d76a78292d",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "height": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "aspect": 1
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Those touched by your kindness often come to help you in your darkest hour.*\n\nIf you’re in mortal peril, maybe alone and outnumbered or stranded without hope, you can use this Ability to summon help.\n\nOnce activated, your GM will choose a character with whom you have a Social Bond to come to your assistance. This could even be a spared foe with whom you’ve formed a Battle Bond.\n\nThe chosen character will miraculously appear just in time to offer you required assistance. For example, they might arrive with reinforcements or a convenient escape craft.\n\nThis Ability cannot be used again until you have had the time to participate in a Downtime Activity."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[A] Never Stand Alone",
    "subtype": "battle princess",
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "id": "I1e2S8ksDacI9lqud8L2"
  },
  {
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "aspect": 1,
              "height": 100,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FHD69QVckjlg6IO1bXkGN.png?alt=media&token=41db7df7-2e0e-4033-82aa-348bc69b5add"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Sometimes even the patience of the wise can be tested. By clenching your fist you can solidify the mana emanating from your target and use it to crush like a vise.*\n\nYou can target an opponent up to 15 ft, or 1 Battlefield Area, away. During a Fight, Mana Crush requires the use of your Action to cast.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Insight vs. your target’s Deftness.\n- **Success:** The target is crushed within a cocoon of mana, taking 3 Hearts of Damage.\n- **Failure:** The Target avoids the brunt of the assault and only takes 1 Heart of Damage.\n\nThis spell is physically taxing to cast and may only safely be used once per Fight. Attempting the spell in the same Fight, or within a few minutes of the last attempt, means you must roll on the Injury Table after the Contest."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "type": "range",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[A][M] Mana Crush",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "sage",
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "id": "Ic9uiRLWCrjz9YkaDFAy"
  },
  {
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FAxWu1TnZS0a3KMzGzWhv.png?alt=media&token=d1b94ead-63d8-4257-a9ae-c701676f8b3e",
            "tokenCrop": {
