  {
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "displayName": "[A][M] Umbra Draconis",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "heretic",
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2Ff4gSdD0EELvXhXj2UzUu.png?alt=media&token=90790cf2-9181-48eb-ba1c-ed03833d4094",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Draconis, The Silhouette Wyrm, is the creature of legend who broke the Sun Machine and battled with Emperor Regulus. He is now but a shadow, though his flames still burn real enough.*\n\nTo call Umbra Draconis you must fall to your knees and shout his name at the top of your lungs. The great dragon emerges, ready to scorch your enemies. Summoning requires 1 Turn.\n\n**Requires a Grit Check**\n- **Success:** Draconis breathes dark flames on to the Battlefield Area you occupy, then vanishes. \n - The flames do not harm you, but everyone else takes 3 Hearts of Flame Damage.\n - Draconis’ flames will also Sunder combustible objects.\n - If the Battlefield Area contains flammable structures or surfaces your GM can choose to set them alight, adding the Harmful Condition to the Area (􀂴 p250).\n- **Failure:** The effects are identical to Success, except you are also harmed by Draconis’ dark flames.\n\nOnce attempted, you cannot use this Ability again for 24 hours."
        }
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        },
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "LPI246LfxS6Wt3eW7YMg"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "displayName": "[A][M] Prince Justiniaus",
    "subtype": "heretic",
    "version": 2,
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "width": 86,
              "x": 6.999999999999964,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 7.3333333333332975,
              "height": 86
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FqJwJwonmD97yHyEjTlYn.png?alt=media&token=2270bec6-acac-44f7-b4ae-23d1a79e135a"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*Justiniaus, The Prince in Chains, is bound to his throne with barbed shackles. A wicked grin graces his torn face when he inflicts suffering upon others.*\n\nKneel and whisper his name and Justiniaus will appear to ensnare your enemies. Summoning requires 1 Action.\n\n**Requires a Grit Check**\n- **Success:** Barbed chains erupt around your chosen target. \n - You can target a foe up to 2 Battlefield Areas away from you.\n - All your target’s limbs are Restrained as the chains circle and constrict around them.\n - The target can be freed if anyone spends a Turn to break the chains.\n - This requires a Might Check. The target loses 1 Heart every time this is attempted, successfully or not.\n - The chains will vanish in an hour, or when you attempt to summon Justiniaus again.\n- **Failure:** A single chain, accompanied by a sinister cackle, erupts from the ground and binds your dominant arm to your body.\n - Your arm is Restrained.\n - You, or an assisting ally, must use an Action to attempt to cut the chains. This requires a Might Check. You lose 1 Heart every time this is attempted, successfully or not.\n\nYou cannot summon Justiniaus again until you are freed."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "type": "range",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        }
      }
    ],
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "id": "LZ7O4zXc5xhgEVz6t9QA"
