  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F2TmcUnDWj1QjKNrHMm85.png?alt=media&token=55af5c92-e577-40db-87ee-f9dd8a900a34"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Your unabated fury manifests itself as large spikes or thorns that project from your Wrath’s Blade, making its wounds even more grievous. However, the toll on your spirit is great.*\n\nYou can choose to inflict an extra Heart of Damage on a successful Attack, but lose 2 of your own.\n\nIf you drop below 0 Hearts when using this Ability, you must roll on the Injury Table after each successful Attack."
        }
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "subtype": "murder princess",
    "displayName": "[S][M] Barbed Justice",
    "version": 2,
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "id": "O2YSDBg0a9qeTtdhM29v"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FPda65pjoFORTYxbp3qpz.png?alt=media&token=cb65716e-e066-4a3f-95cb-94692e701dc0",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*You’ve heard the old tales that say even the scariest monsters can be subdued with a pinch of spice or deterred by a drop of moon-plum juice. Is there something to them, or are they just stories?*\n\nYou may choose a consumable material (such as lantern oil or a treat) to act as a deterrent to an Unearthly Adversary. Unearthly Adversaries include: Asura, Devas, Demons, Undead, Unshaped, or any creature with 4 or more Allegiance points.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Insight vs. the Adversary’s Aura. In addition:\n- You must expend 1 Unit of the chosen consumable material.\n- If a rare or appropriate consumable is selected, your GM may offer you a Minor Bonus (+2). For example, Bright Water against a Dark Aligned enemy.\n\n**Success**: You can choose between one of two outcomes:\n- **Ability loss**: The Adversary loses the use of an Ability of your choice.\n- **Protective circle**: The Adversary cannot enter a circle made from the protective consumable. 1 Unit can create a circle for a single PC, more Units can be used to create larger circles on this basis.\n- The effect lasts for 24 hours.\n\n**Failure**: You’ve wasted your consumable and look rather silly!\n\nUse of this Ability is subject to the rule of Diminishing Returns."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "subtype": "factotum",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[S] Folklorist",
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "id": "OHJFk940ZihaMg9wVx19"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "subtype": "heretic",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[S][M] Deacon Galrave",
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 7.916666666666666,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 80.66666666666666,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 8.999999999999913,
              "width": 80.66666666666666
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FAo4PXp6Cpw4JXT14oqgv.png?alt=media&token=bb4882cc-6b07-4f99-a4f6-b64d604a27c8"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*Galrave, Cloaked in Fear, is a broad and imposing figure. His terrible smile is frightening enough, but his laugh is blood-curdling.*\n\nThrow your hands in the air and shout his full name and Galrave, a fearsome spirit, swirls into being. Summoning requires 1 Action. \n\n**Requires a Grit Check**\n- **Success:** Galrave’s laugh echoes loudly, instilling doubt and panic in anyone you consider an enemy.\n - Hostiles within 1 Battlefield Area of you must make a successful Grit Check or be Terrified of you for 24 Hours.\n- **Failure:** Galrave honors you with his grim regard then vanishes. You shudder for a moment, and miss your next Turn."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        },
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
