  {
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[S] Kawarimi",
    "subtype": "sneak",
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FFnNmCnKgCxoqK6uJPBIT.png?alt=media&token=46aae07c-327a-4427-b8ea-77b3b8b19490"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*This technique allows you to nullify an attack via a misdirection. Your opponent strikes, convinced their blow has reached its target… only to discover they’ve hit a log wearing your hat!*\n\nIf you’ve been hit by an Attack, you can attempt to avoid taking any Damage with Kawarimi.\n\n**Requires a Deftness Check**\n**Success**: You manage to completely dodge the blow by slipping out of something you were wearing. For example, a cloak, a hat, or even by tearing off a sleeve.\n- Normal Outfits used with this Ability are only partially removed, becoming a Tattered Outfit.\n- Already Tattered Outfits are simply destroyed. Embarrassing!\n- Armor or Outfits of Magical Materials are discarded but otherwise undamaged.\n\n**Failure**: You take the Damage.\n\nThis Ability will not work if you have nothing left to slip out of! \nThis Ability may only be used once per Fight."
        }
      }
    ],
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "PvnurO9ZYMcCfF9ggvEO"
  },
