  {
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "displayName": "[S][M] Bushi Miyabi",
    "subtype": "heretic",
    "version": 2,
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "height": 70.66666666666666,
              "y": 12.666666666666679,
              "unit": "%",
              "x": 15.000000000000021,
              "width": 70.66666666666666,
              "aspect": 1
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F1MQxDKdSLW9eS8AhgShQ.png?alt=media&token=001d4178-5230-40fd-9b2c-73dda5e1ac8f"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Miyabi, Apparition of Borrowed Wrath, is a raging spirit contained within elaborate armor. Her hand grasps a broken blade, which she swings with vengeful fury.*\n\nPoint at an enemy, yell her name, and Miyabi will materialize next to your chosen foe. Summoning requires 1 Action.\n\n**Requires a Grit Check**\n- **Success:** Miyabi manifests next to your chosen target and engages them in combat.\n - You can set Miyabi on a foe up to 2 Battlefield Areas away from you.\n - She strikes with a Standard Weapon.\n - Her Attack Bonus is always the same as her target’s.\n - She has Defense Rating 12. \n - Her Speed Rating is Fast.\n - She evaporates if struck or when her target has been killed, but once summoned she cannot be called off or dismissed.\n- **Failure:** Miyabi manifests to take a single swipe at you for your impertinence, then vanishes.\n - When striking you, her Attack Bonus is +2 and does 1 Heart of Damage."
        },
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        },
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "RdudiuJEkSk6OLz1hFaz"
  },
  {
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "displayName": "[A][M] Dowager Collette",
    "subtype": "heretic",
    "version": 2,
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 9.666666666666632,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 82,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 12.666666666666632,
              "width": 82
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FZTJ1aeqmLrzSyxBojbUP.png?alt=media&token=75be19d8-ef2d-44fe-8590-70f74d032352"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*Collette, Our Maiden of Toxicity, is haggard and pale. Her mouth, full of rotted teeth, spews poisonous breath.*\n\nThe Dowager is called upon by covering your mouth in mock revulsion. She spasms into existence to belch toxic gas. Summoning requires 1 Action.\n\n**Requires a Grit Check**\n- **Success:** The Dowager appears above a Battlefield Area of your choice. She cackles before spewing out a poisonous mist over the Area below making it Harmful until the end of the Fight.\n- **Failure:** You begin to choke and cough on noxious fumes. This prevents you from speaking, and therefore calling other Sealed Names, until the end of your next Turn."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "RhjgIyfA3PVrUBEr1lCi"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "murder princess",
    "displayName": "[A][M] Red Petal Revenge",
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "height": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%"
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FtqQjcOy1DKSSu8hQYjDc.png?alt=media&token=33da645c-3a60-43ee-9e77-d7d047f3d138"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Picking a rose in haste can prick your fingers, and so those who wish to do you harm will suffer the consequences.*\n\nIf you are hit in a Fight, or suffer an Ailment caused by an enemy’s Ability, you can attempt to get revenge on your aggressor.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Grit vs. the attacker’s Grit.\n**Success**: Your attacker suffers the same Damage, or Ailment, that they inflicted on you.\n- If an Ailment can not be applied to your attacker, they take a Heart of Damage instead.\n\nRed Petal Revenge may only be used once every 24 hours."
        }
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "id": "RvhLBonT21DTKUdvWv68"
  },
  {
    "displayName": "[A][M] Demystify",
    "subtype": "sage",
    "version": 2,
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2Fx1T10D5jxvmFPgF3BUnD.png?alt=media&token=6164c2e3-fbaf-44da-8691-a8eaeeac0ecc"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Just as you can weave a web of mana, so too can you unravel it. Deep knowledge of mana manipulation allows you to undo others’ spells. The performance of this counter-magic is usually accompanied by a rude or condescending gesture toward the opposing spell caster.*\n\nYou can attempt to end a single persistent magical effect. This might be a curse, arcane barrier, or the enchantments on an Artifact or Imbued Item. In a Fight, Demystify requires the use of your Action to cast.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Insight vs. the Aptitude required to cast the opposing Magical Ability. If no Aptitude is specified, then use Aura.\n- **Success:** The spell is unravelled.\n- **Failure:** You cannot dispel the effect, and cannot try to dispel the effect again for 24 hours.\n\nThis Ability only causes Artifacts or Imbued items to lose their enchantment for 24 hours."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "id": "S3oGrV3vXSfOxEcPziuP"
  },
  {
    "effects": [],
    "type": "Abilities",
    "displayName": "[S] Dreadful",
    "subtype": "Heretic",
    "version": 2,
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FIIOHfkRN0ndYxmRJmnAh.png?alt=media&token=f824b45a-d9dc-4c70-bb6a-22213d0d928e",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "height": 100,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "aspect": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Extended contact with the Sealed Names has altered your appearance and mannerisms, making you deeply unsettling to be around. You have also developed a twisted empathy that enables you to sense the fears and weaknesses of others.*\n\nYou have an Edge on rolls that involve intimidating, frightening or repulsing someone.\n\nAfter a short period of observation, or 1 Turn during a Fight, you can attempt to detect what someone fears the most.\n\n**Requires an Aura Check**\n**Success:** You learn one thing that upsets, scares or disgusts your target. The weakness revealed could be emotional or physical."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "id": "S6zbsGl7BcDgNwctuKrL"
  },
  {
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FA2G3qoknLOSR6Xh55mic.png?alt=media&token=e55c8547-ed08-4cec-a821-4231ff6ff231",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "height": 100
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Like a rat, you are most deadly when cornered. When you find yourself encircled by the town guard or an angry mob, you have a few manoeuvres to tip the balance back in your favor.*\n\nYou can attempt to redirect a failed Attack roll against you onto another target, if they are in the offending weapon’s Range.\n\n**Requires a Deftness Check**\n**Success**: You redirect the attack towards your chosen target.\n- If the original Attack roll exceeds your chosen target’s Defense Rating, they suffer the consequences."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "subtype": "sneak",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[A] Borrowed Blade",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "id": "T822ZU0htYTxnpmDDa2S"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "raider",
    "displayName": "[A] Sure Kill Strike",
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FdJwCtjP4Bb4a3f2suTeg.png?alt=media&token=dba082a5-e19f-476c-98b2-c06c0e19baff",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*To you, execution is an art form.*\n\nTo attempt a Sure Kill Strike you must first declare a target at the beginning of your Turn. Next, you must make an Attack roll against your chosen target.\n\nIf successful…\n**Make an Execution roll**\n- If your initial Attack roll was over the Extra Damage threshold, then + 2 to the result.\n- Next, Divide the end result by 2 (rounding up).\n- To succeed, the result must be higher than your target’s remaining Hearts.\n - **Success**: Your target loses all their remaining Hearts and dies. If it’s a PC, they are forced to roll on the Injury Table.\n - **Failure**: Your hit is resolved like a standard Attack.\n\nSure Kill can only be attempted once every 24 hours."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "id": "TJlQSTTYm49RFh8fVEJT"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 6.666666666666655,
              "width": 88.00000000000003,
              "y": 2.999999999999989,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 88.00000000000003
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F5Y7JLTt7inJvO3yqC9Rn.png?alt=media&token=1667a673-d992-483d-a506-1b5cb151735a"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*The Count, With Heart Most Cold, is a loveless and noble figure. His joyless gaze petrifies those who lock eyes with him.*\n\nTurn dispassionately towards a target, up to 2 Battlefield Areas away, and Paris will materialise by your side to stare them down. Summoning requires 1 Action.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Grit vs. the target’s Deftness.\n- Success: Paris levels his icy glare at your enemy:\n - Your target is encased in ice and is Petrified (􀂴 p270).\n - The target can be freed if anyone spends a Turn to break the ice. This requires a successful Might Check.\n- Failure: Paris scoffs then freezes your legs and vanishes. You cannot move from your current position.\n  - Paris won’t return unless you are freed from the ice. This requires you, or an assisting ally, to use an Action and make a Might Check."
        },
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "type": "range",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        }
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[S][M] Count Paris",
    "subtype": "heretic",
    "version": 2,
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "id": "TYunPpi3eWYqKkIaf3Hr"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "subtype": "champion",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[A] Sentinel",
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "height": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FU5vD1BJuto1FFJpws6wQ.png?alt=media&token=36a9ca31-c50a-4234-8b2a-5046d44229bc"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Being the toughest among your companions means you’re happy to soak up hits for them when you can.*\n\nYou can redirect any successful physical Attack on an ally occupying the same Battlefield Area as you onto yourself. The original Attack roll must now beat your Defense Rating to do you harm.\n\nThis ability can’t be used against area effects like harmful smoke."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "id": "Ul8Zo4RtnxtSDTl4LvM9"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FR0pDDsAUAWtQ84I2eDpZ.png?alt=media&token=2a17aa7a-e006-47c2-a823-730088b848d2",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100
            }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*One of the earliest tricks you learned was how to animate objects using the mana left behind by another living creature’s touch. With this you can breathe wondrous life into simple tools and children’s toys.*\n\nWith some singing, or gentle coaxing, you can attempt to make a single object spring to life and perform the function it was originally designed for.\n\nAn object needs to have been used within the last 3 months to retain the residual mana required for the spell.\n\n**Requires an Insight Check**\n**Success:** Your chosen object begins to move. \n- A door knob will rotate and the door click open, a toy soldier will march, and a Physician’s Kit will perform surgery.\n- The object will perform long enough to complete a single task, then the mana is expended.\n- If a Check or Contest is required, your Insight is used.\n- A Melee Weapon may be animated for a single Attack. The strike uses your Attack Bonus.\n- A Shield can float and Parry a single Attack on you, or a nearby ally, before falling to the ground.\n- A Missile Weapon can fire a single shot, if ammunition is available.\n\nSuccessful or not, once an object has been targeted by Prestidigitonium the ambient mana is disrupted and the Ability won’t work on it again unless…\n- The object is used again, although it takes 24 hours for the required mana to settle."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[S][M] Prestidigitonium",
    "subtype": "sage",
    "version": 2,
    "id": "VgbfAASnQsmItMMiLhqn"
  },
