  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "height": 100,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "aspect": 1
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FHDCuUM2uHxtfMKVGyjj0.png?alt=media&token=89214011-da5c-4309-8ebe-5e13191e1a26"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Your patience with hostile magic is thin, and your mere annoyance can unravel even the most carefully crafted spell.*\n\nYou can attempt to nullify a single persistent magical effect that is irritating you, or any of your allies that are located in the same Battlefield Area as you. For example, you can try to dispel a magically inflicted Ailment or a sorcerous barrier.\n\n**Requires a Grit Check **\n**Success**: The magic will be suppressed so long as you are in the same Battlefield Area and still subject to the annoying effect. For example, the caster would regain the use of their suppressed Ability or the sorcerous barrier would return once you have passed or been pacified.\n- Vexed Dispel can be triggered the instant you are annoyed, and does not require an Action to cast.\n- You cannot Dispel magic that is instant, such as a damaging magical blast.\n\nYou cannot use this Ability again for 24 Hours after it has been successfully used."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Dark Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[A][M] Vexed Dispel",
    "subtype": "murder princess",
    "version": 2,
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "id": "Vnbsw1K2Ng5602wkZLrH"
  },
  {
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F2TmcUnDWj1QjKNrHMm85.png?alt=media&token=55af5c92-e577-40db-87ee-f9dd8a900a34",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "height": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "aspect": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Your frightful countenance shakes the resolve of even the strongest foes. *\n\nAt the start of a Fight you can Glare at a single enemy at the start of your Turn.\n\n- **Rank 1**: The target of your Glare loses a single Heart.\n- **Rank 5**: Your target must now also participate in a Contest with you, their Grit vs. your Aura.\n  - **Success**: Your enemy is unnerved and incurs a Snag on all Attack rolls against you.\n\nIf this Ability reduces an adversary to 0 Hearts, or lower, they flee from the battle or surrender on the spot.\n\nA target may only be affected by one Glare per Fight."
        }
      }
    ],
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "murder princess",
