    "subtype": "sage",
    "displayName": "[S][M] Sage's Staff - Spell Push",
    "version": 2,
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F0CkM6Tmwtfj0qVvjTkIX.png?alt=media&token=3ce12dbe-657d-499c-baf1-950965091e5d",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "aspect": 1,
              "height": 100,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Staves are an iconic part of any Sage’s inventory. Your elegant wand, or gnarled walking stick, carries your personal sigil and is the primary conduit for your magic.*\n\n**Spell Push**: With a dramatic gesture and a shout, you can use your staff to magically shove things about.\n- The Push can affect things up to 15 ft away.\n- The Push exerts the same amount of force as an adult human.\n- The Push is always executed with full power and can not be used with any delicacy.\n\nIf the Push is used in a Check or Contest, the spell’s Might is the same as your Insight. This might include attempting to shove against a monster, or moving a heavy stone.\n\nIf the Push is used as an Attack, it is treated as an Unarmed strike, and can strike at a target up to 1 Battlefield Area away.\n-  Unarmed strikes suffer a Snag on their Attack roll when directed at armed or armored enemies."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "id": "X2ZYz8N1lkooZeOiR8tA"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F9BIKNraPfZbfvtH475gv.png?alt=media&token=546ef8d2-a644-45ca-8e94-797143250a6c"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*Your soul burns so brightly that your Heart’s Blade transcends its material form to become a shard of devastating light.*\n\nYou can activate this Ability at will upon summoning your Heart’s Blade.\n\n**Slice of Light**: Your Heart’s Blade is now a glowing shaft of light that does an extra Heart of Bright Damage  in addition to the weapon’s Mundane Damage.\n\n**Purifying Flare**: After a successful strike with the Heart’s Blade, the light can be discharged to irradiate your target, causing an additional Heart of Bright Damage which dispels the Ability.\n\nThis Ability can be used once per Session and lasts for the duration of the Fight. If Purifying Flare is used, the Ability is exhausted immediately."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "battle princess",
    "displayName": "[A][M] Radiant Blade",
    "id": "Z5BqmUhPiJwE9DHdmOBD"
  },
  {
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FU5vD1BJuto1FFJpws6wQ.png?alt=media&token=36a9ca31-c50a-4234-8b2a-5046d44229bc"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Your mere presence is overwhelming. A shout, smirk, or simple glare can unsettle even a worthy opponent.*\n\nDuring a Fight, you can use your Action to attempt to intimidate an opponent up to 2 Battlefield Areas away.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Aura vs. the target’s Grit.\n**Success**: You lock eyes. Your target is rendered temporarily inactive, missing their next Turn.\n\nThis ability will only work once on the same target every 24 hours.\n\nCreatures that are incapable of fear (such as unthinking machines, mindless undead, or colossi) are immune to such intimidation."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
