    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FFnNmCnKgCxoqK6uJPBIT.png?alt=media&token=46aae07c-327a-4427-b8ea-77b3b8b19490",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Thanks to some lessons from a choice tutor, the Ninja of the Seven Holy Isles or your sucker punching sibling, you have become pretty good at catching others off guard with your fists.*\n\nYou are able to make Unarmed Attacks as if wielding a Concealed Weapon. Drawing and striking with a Concealed Weapon is one Action.\n\n**Weapon Ability, Sneaky Swipe:**\nIf your target isn’t aware of your Concealed Weapon you may attempt to Ambush them, even when you are in plain sight.\n- Your Target must be in the same Battlefield Area as you, but otherwise this attack works like a normal Ambush.\n- If your Ambush is successful, others using Concealed or Thrown weapons can join in the Ambush."
        }
      }
    ],
