  {
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[S] Cutting Wit",
    "subtype": "factotum",
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FPda65pjoFORTYxbp3qpz.png?alt=media&token=cb65716e-e066-4a3f-95cb-94692e701dc0"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Words may not break their bones, but they can still cut deep.*\n\nIn a Fight, you can attempt to unsettle an enemy by directing inflammatory words at them.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Aura vs. your target’s Grit.\n**Success**: Your target must either: \n- Immediately attempt to Attack you on their next Turn, or…\n- Lose 1 Heart.\n\nIf they have no Hearts left, they must try and Attack you."
        }
      }
    ],
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "ZiMTtHeM3TolFwyhX1v0"
  },
  {
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FU5vD1BJuto1FFJpws6wQ.png?alt=media&token=36a9ca31-c50a-4234-8b2a-5046d44229bc"
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*Even when calm and still, your soul crackles with a terrifying energy. A mere look can spread this force outwards, sapping the fighting spirit and bloodlust from lesser warriors in your presence. *\n\nYou can attempt to subdue opponents of lower Rank with a menacing glower.\n\n**Requires an Aura Check**\n**Success**: All adversaries within shouting distance step back and won’t engage you, or your allies, unless you strike first.\n\nThis ability has no effect on adversaries with a Rank equal to or higher than yours.\n\nThis Ability may only be used once in a game Session."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "subtype": "champion",
