  {
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FYw1If1R71OaS0llkinZn.png?alt=media&token=dacdb246-44fa-425a-a00b-cb8a211da116"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*Nothing clears a room like a mana kaboom! You make magical explosives.*\n\n**Rank 1**\nOnce per Fight, you can conjure a Mana Grenade, a non-lethal weapon designed to subdue. \n- Mana Grenades work like regular Grenades, except…\n- They do Twilight Magic Damage.\n- Targets reduced to 0 Hearts, or less, are knocked unconscious (or fall inert if they are Mechanoids or Undead) for an hour.\n\n**Rank 5:**\nOnce every 24 hours, you can conjure a Mana Bomb, a more violent and deadly variant of the Mana Grenade. \n- Mana Bombs work like standard Bombs, except…\n- They do Twilight Magic Damage."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        },
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[S][M] Eldritch Explosives",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "sage",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "id": "aGPy1RXasYkjX3U13v6w"
  },
  {
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "displayName": "[S] Giant Killer",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "champion",
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FsJwaUoYzPzD5HEpsMMmR.png?alt=media&token=8cce06f3-d719-4bf7-ba1f-7618e3972167",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "aspect": 1,
              "height": 100,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0
            }
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*The bigger they are, the harder you hit.*\n\nYou do an additional Heart of Damage on a successful Attack against Massive or Colossal Creatures.\n\nYou get an Edge on any rolls needed to move between, scale, or remain on a Colossal Creature’s Strike Points."
        }
      }
    ],
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "id": "bMluNJm9Q89SNa1oIy8Z"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "subtype": "heretic",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[S][M] Squire Marlow",
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FbMM0NhPbQC9QBWfGhkLq.png?alt=media&token=37501511-d613-4d19-b9b2-b9762322f13c",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Marlow, Whom All Chosen Know, is there to make sure all your needs are attended to. This genteel and unfailingly polite figure is a great deal more forgiving than the other Sealed Names.*\n\nSpeak his name calmly and Marlow, a servant-like spirit, emerges from the shadow to do your bidding. Summoning takes 1 Action.\n\n**Requires a Grit Check**\n- **Success:** Marlow will appear and carry out a single task you give him.\n - The task must be something that Marlow can complete in a few minutes. He will attempt to accomplish his task with competence and endeavour.\n - In a Fight, Marlow performs as a Custrel (􀂴 p186) equipped with a Quick Weapon.\n - Marlow vanishes upon the completion of his task, or if reduced to 0 Hearts.\n - He must be summoned again if you wish to make further use of his services.\n- **Failure:** Marlow gently refuses your request, and promptly vanishes. \n\nAfter a failed summoning, Marlow can’t be called again for 24 hours."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "id": "bx17owLSbs2fRF5JAfl5"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": [
        "HwYLq98tYuY9lEEODMru3sEGeTM2"
      ]
    },
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[S] Into the Fray",
    "subtype": "champion",
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FsJwaUoYzPzD5HEpsMMmR.png?alt=media&token=8cce06f3-d719-4bf7-ba1f-7618e3972167",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "height": 100,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "aspect": 1
            }
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*You are able to vary your fighting style to suit the battle, applying caution, flair or precision when and where it is required.*\n\nEach Round during a Fight, you can choose between the following:\n- **Daring**: Perform an Attack Stunt without making a wager.\n- **Tooth and Nail**: Use a mundane (non-magical) Attack to harm a creature that is normally immune to them.\n- **Whirlwind Defense**: Temporarily increase your Defense Rating:\n  - **Rank 1**: +1 to Defense Rating.\n  - **Rank 5**: +2 to Defense Rating.\n\nAll bonuses last until the start of your next Turn."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "id": "bzbQHBIadb6joxrgXpGJ"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F7pDM7eJPlZdoLHLYA2bN.png?alt=media&token=8ae317bc-67ce-4e58-be6a-fbf1836eae4d"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*You’re better at outsmarting your foe than you are at going toe to toe.*\n\nYou receive a Minor Bonus (+2) when attempting a Combat Trick."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[A] Tricky Combatant",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "factotum",
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "id": "cfeIbXD48DfWUE4tENyS"
  },
  {
    "details": [
      {
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2Fx1T10D5jxvmFPgF3BUnD.png?alt=media&token=6164c2e3-fbaf-44da-8691-a8eaeeac0ecc",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "height": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%"
            }
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*You politely request cooperation from ambient mana. With some clear spoken instructions and a bow, or curtsy, you can re-arrange a cluttered room, or quickly assemble a barricade in front of an approaching enemy.*\n\nYou can attempt to persuade local mana to manipulate objects in your immediate surroundings.\n\n**Requires an Insight Check**\n**Success:** The local mana swirls and twists to do your bidding. \n- You can perform a simple task that would normally require several creatures acting together to accomplish.\n- For example: Smashing all the breakable pots in a shed at once, alphabetizing a room full of books, or stacking loose stones into a makeshift set of stairs.\n- The area of effect should be no larger than a small house.\n\nDuring a Fight, you can manipulate a single Battlefield Area to:\n- Add the Precarious or Sheltered Condition to a Battlefield Area, providing there are enough suitable objects scattered around. \n- Remove an existing Condition from a Battlefield Area, if you can agree with your GM on how this Ability could do it. For example, pushing away a choking mist.\n\nSuccessful or not, any objects moved or disrupted by this spell have their ambient mana burnt away and cannot be affected by this Ability or Prestidigitonium for another 24 hours."
        },
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "type": "range",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        }
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[A][M] Harmonious Geomancy",
    "subtype": "sage",
    "version": 2,
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "id": "conwzNnsKMZRHeOZhfBi"
  },
  {
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "height": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "aspect": 1
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F9BIKNraPfZbfvtH475gv.png?alt=media&token=546ef8d2-a644-45ca-8e94-797143250a6c"
          }
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*When you so desire, a brilliant flame flickers around your Heart’s Blade, making it all the more deadly.*\n\n**Blazing Desire**: Your Heart’s Blade is ablaze and now does Flame Damage instead of Mundane Damage.\n\n**Yearning Embrace**: After a successful Attack, the fire can be discharged to engulf your target and cause an additional Heart of Damage. This exhausts the Ability.\n\nPassion’s Fire can only be used once per Fight."
        },
        "type": "description"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "battle princess",
    "displayName": "[S][M] Passion's Fire",
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "cpdYj8HYM47rmcChixiw"
  },
  {
    "subtype": "sneak",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[S] Sticky Fingers",
    "details": [
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FFnNmCnKgCxoqK6uJPBIT.png?alt=media&token=46aae07c-327a-4427-b8ea-77b3b8b19490",
            "tokenCrop": {
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0,
              "aspect": 1,
              "height": 100,
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0
            }
          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "*While you would prefer the term ‘Treasure Hunter’ to ‘Thief’, you’re skilled in relieving others of their possessions — even in the midst of battle.*\n\nYou can attempt to take an item from an individual in the same Battlefield Area as you after you perform a successful Attack, Attack Stunt, or Combat Trick on them.\n\nThe item you can acquire is limited by the following:\n- It cannot be armor, an outfit or something currently being held by the target.\n- It must be something within your reach. A worn locket or ring would count, something sealed away in a backpack would not. \n- It cannot occupy more than 2 Inventory Slots.\n\n**Requires a Deftness Check**\n**Success**: You snatched it."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      }
    ],
    "effects": [],
    "type": "abilities",
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "id": "dEw9vMr4lDC3AWL38bru"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
      "users": [],
      "level": "private"
    },
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "aspect": 1,
              "x": 0,
              "width": 100,
              "y": 0,
              "unit": "%",
              "height": 100
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2F8FwX0SvsvpwYnYfrTNTO.png?alt=media&token=9f94a9a7-a02d-4f3c-be8c-f1e26d3cea59"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Diligent training and discipline allow you to pacify your enemy with a flurry of blows.*\n\nOnce per Turn you can take a follow-up Action after a successful Attack roll.\n- The follow-up Action must be an Attack, Attack Stunt, Attack Assist, or Combat Trick.\n- Making this follow-up Action is physically demanding, and you lose a Heart after performing the technique.\n- If you’ve run out of Hearts you will roll on the Injury Table."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[A] Lightning and Thunder",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "raider",
    "type": "abilities",
    "effects": [],
    "id": "dNFZAQeHMxx5lk26Qpz4"
  },
  {
    "details": [
      {
        "type": "image",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "image": {
            "tokenCrop": {
              "unit": "%",
              "y": 0,
              "height": 100,
              "aspect": 1,
              "width": 100,
              "x": 0
            },
            "url": "https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/rpg-pbp.appspot.com/o/games%2F1WLk8WgaysyvKtNs5P0a%2Fimages%2FwX87fAYjqIHi8IRvr2Nx.png?alt=media&token=22b1044e-888f-4725-b0a1-04512dcc9473"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Powerful Bright Magic lies within you. It can wash away all falsehoods and leave nothing but the naked truth, including both honest wishes and dark secrets.*\n\nYou can activate this Ability whenever you are speaking to another individual, or at the start of a Negotiation.\n\n**Requires a Contest**\nYour Aura vs. the Grit of anyone in earshot.\n- Anyone who loses the Contest is unable to lie, deceive, or mislead you for a 24 hour period, although they can still refuse to answer your questions.\n- Unfortunately, you are also subject to the effects of this Ability for the same 24 hour period."
        }
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "range": "Gain 1 Bright Allegiance Point."
        },
        "type": "range"
      }
    ],
    "subtype": "battle princess",
    "version": 2,
    "displayName": "[A][M] Opened Hearts",
