          }
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "type": "description",
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*The quickest path between two places is often right through whatever is in the way.*\n\nYou get an Edge on any Attack rolls dedicated to Sundering something. \n\nAny non-magical shield used to Parry your physical Attacks is immediately Sundered, due to the crushing power of your blows.\n\nThis Ability can not be used in conjunction with an Attack Stunt."
        }
      }
    ],
