        "visibility": "full"
      },
      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*You can organize a team offensive.*\n\nWhen you perform an Attack Assist, you target an enemy instead of an ally.\n- **Rank 1**: Any Attack rolls made on the chosen enemy during that Turn receive a Minor Bonus (+2).\n- **Rank 5**: Any Attack rolls on your target now receive an Edge, instead of the Minor Bonus."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
