          }
        },
        "type": "image"
      },
      {
        "value": {
          "description": "*A working knowledge of combined warfare, and the ability to organize the troops, is all you need to turn the tide of a battle.*\n\nIf you have a Social Bond with an ally, you can grant them an additional Action on their Turn during a Fight. This Ability can be used in addition to any other Actions you’re allowed to perform on your Turn.\n\nThis can be used once per Fight."
        },
        "visibility": "full",
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
