      {
        "visibility": "full",
        "value": {
          "description": "*Your animated and tuneful battle commands grant those listening a coordinated, rhythmic, combat flair.*\n\nYou can attempt to coordinate your allies during a Fight, granting all participants a Minor Bonus (+2) to a single roll on their Turn.\n\nThis Ability can be used in conjunction with your other permitted Actions, but you must declare the use of this Ability at the beginning of your Turn.\n\n**Requires an Aura Check**\n**Success**: 3 – 2 – 1 – Go! Your Battle Dance begins…\n- You can apply a Minor Bonus (+2) to a single roll made on your Turn.\n- Once you have started a Dance, allies in the same Battlefield Area can choose to join in. To do so they must make an Aura Check at the start of your team’s Turn.\n  - **Ally success**: Your ally jumps into the groove gaining a Minor Bonus (+2) for a roll made on their Turn.\n  - **Ally failure**: Your ally makes a misstep, disrupting the Dance. All Dancers lose their bonus this Turn. An ally can attempt to re-join the dance on the next Turn.\n- Each Turn Dancers must make a successful Aura Check for the Dance to continue.\n\n**Failure**: You stumble or stutter, and must apply a Minor Penalty (-2) to a roll of your choice made this Turn.\n\nAfter starting a Dance, you can not use this Ability again for 24 hours. With your GM’s approval, you can use this Ability in Linked Contests, like a chase sequence."
        },
        "type": "description"
      }
    ],
    "displayName": "[S] Battle Dance",
    "version": 2,
    "subtype": "battle princess",
    "privacy": {
      "level": "private",
      "users": []
    },
    "id": "sCKh7NaVhZ5DFG6eV3Vu"
  },
  {
    "privacy": {
