    "details": [
      {
        "type": "description",
        "value": {
          "description": "Range: Melee\nDamage: 1\nThreshold: 20\n\nWhen wielding one-handed you suffer a Minor Penalty (-2) on Attack rolls, Attack Stunts, & Combat Tricks.\n\n**Weapon Ability, Deadly Sweep:**\n- You can hit two enemies in the same Battlefield Area with one Attack.\n- Make a single Attack roll, and apply the result to both enemies."
        },
        "visibility": "full"
      },
